      "raw": "<p>Vicious Onslaught reads &quot;Plague Rat deals each hero target <em>other than the hero target with the lowest HP</em> 2 melee damage and 2 toxic damage.&quot; My question is about the italicized part-what if the entire team except one person has been incapacitated? Doesn&#39;t that make him both the highest and lowest HP hero target? So... does this mean that hero does not take any damage from this attack, since he is the lowest HP target? I guess the same question can be generalized to all instances where <em>other than the hero target with the lowest/highest HP</em> can be found...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A follow up question. What if all heroes (more than 1) were at the same HP, making all of them simultaneously the lowest and highest HP targets?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I will be very grateful to anyone who can shed some light on this, and I apologize if this has been posted previously.</p>",
