      "id": 60794,
      "name": "dypaca",
      "username": "dypaca",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-21T16:24:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If there is only one Hero Target, Vicious Onslaught will do no damage.&nbsp; There are no Hero Targets other than the Hero Target with the lowest HP.&nbsp; Note that attacks like this are rare, typically they specify who they hit rather than who they don't.</p><p>If all Hero Targets are tied, then you still choose one to be the lowest HP and Plague Rat hits the rest.&nbsp; It's just the reverse of an attack that goes for the lowest HP, where you have to break the tie and choose one to be considered the lowest.</p>",
